c=json.loads((r/'tools/game-series.json').read_text());c['avengefps']={'name':'Avenge FPS','symbol':'✦','revision':'avengefps-v1','package':['game.html','three.min.js','software-renderer.js','engine.js','core.js','render.js','game.js','THREE-LICENSE.txt'],'category':'Hero arena FPS','summary':'Four heroes · eight weapons · spells · four objective modes','controls':'WASD · mouse · hero abilities · big touch controls','variants':[{'kicker':a,'title':b,'copy':t,'tone':'night'} for a,b,t in [('PICK YOUR HERO','Abilities change everything.','Four heroes with grenades, shurikens, axes, grapples, dashes and totem traps. Build your spell deck during each match.'),('PLAY THE OBJECTIVE','Own the ring. Bank the coins.','Point control, Black Coin, Gun Game and a three-versus-three cart escort. Four original arenas and three AI levels.'),('BUILD YOUR SPELL DECK','One card. A different fight.','Earn tier XP, pause to select a card, and imbue your hero ability with frost, venom, shock or other effects.'),('EVERY DEVICE. EVERY ARENA.','Your thumbs are welcome.','Large independent touch controls, drag or locked mouse aiming, eight weapon choices and a no-stakes practice range.')]],'features':[['Heroes with character','Four ability pairs, bouncing grenades, trap totems, grappling and wall-safe dashing.'],['A match worth playing','Four objective modes, original maps, weapon progression, AI rivals and spell cards.'],['Play your way','Keyboard, mouse and large touch controls. Career XP, local saves and three native mods.']],'mods':[['avengemoon','Moon Gravity','☾','Lower gravity increases airtime for every hero.'],['avengeammo','Endless Ammunition','∞','Weapons never run out of loaded ammunition. Both sides keep normal fire rates.'],['avengequick','Quick Casting','✦','Both hero abilities have half their normal cooldown.']]};(r/'tools/game-series.json').write_text(json.dumps(c,indent=2)+'\n')
(d/'README.md').write_text('# Avenge FPS\n\nOriginal PocketVM hero-arena FPS inspired by the objective, loadout and spell-card format of Venge.io. Single-player against AI, no online multiplayer or accounts. Four heroes have main and secondary abilities; spells imbue main ability hits. Earn tier XP by eliminations and objectives. Four maps, four modes, eight weapons, three difficulty levels and practice.\n\nWASD movement, Space jump, click/Q fire, right-click/Shift aim, F main ability, E secondary ability, R reload, 1–4/wheel switch weapon, B spell deck. On touch: independent joystick, drag to look, fire, aim, jump, reload, ability, secondary and switch controls. Pause on blur and orientation changes.\n\nStore packages embed all JavaScript and the licensed Three.js runtime offline. Career saves are source-checked and sanitized by PocketVM. Three downloadable mods use isolated saves. Original procedural low-poly art. Reference: official Venge Social Club wiki https://social.venge.io/ (hero abilities, loadouts and modes).\n')
